{"ex-209-1":{"id":"ex-209-1","chapter":"209","number":1,"title":"角速率與線速率","question":"<p>思薇和珊妮分別與旋轉木馬的中心點 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相距 3 m 和 2 m，她們以恆角速率轉動半圈需時 10 s。</p><p>(a) 求她們的角速率，答案以 rad s<sup>–1</sup> 表示。</p><p>(b) 求她們在 8 s 內的角位移，答案以弧度和度來表示。</p><p>(c) 求她們的線速率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/25f82a25ce41fe2e2c626dc9.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:444.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 角速率 ω = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>θ</mi><mi>t</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{θ}{t}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{π}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.314 rad s<sup>–1</sup></p><p>(b) θ = ω<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{π}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 8 = 2.51 rad</p><p>此外，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>θ</mi><mrow><mn>360</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{θ}{360°}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2.51</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{2.51}{2π}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>θ = 144°</p><p>(c) 思薇的線速率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω = 3 × 0.314 = 0.942 m s<sup>–1</sup> 珊妮的線速率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω = 2 × 0.314 = 0.628 m s<sup>–1</sup></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>轉半圈的 θ = π</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":7,"kind":"question","box":[188.16530090332031,56.288983398437495,565.1653009033203,348.52085876464844],"text":"例 題 1 角速率與線速率\r\n思薇和珊妮分別與旋轉木馬的中心點 O 相距 3 m 和 2 m，她們以恆\r\n角速率轉動半圈需時 10 s。\r\n2 m\r\n3 m\r\nO\r\n珊妮\r\n思薇\r\n珊妮 思薇\r\n(a) 求她們的角速率，答案以 rad s–1 表示。\r\n(b) 求她們在 8 s 內的角位移，答案以弧度和度來表示。\r\n(c) 求她們的線速率。\r\n"},{"page":7,"kind":"answer","box":[188.16530090332031,348.52085876464844,565.1653009033203,586.0579833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 角速率 ω = θ\r\nt\r\n = π\r\n10\r\n = 0.314 rad s–1\r\n(b) θ = ωt = π\r\n10\r\n× 8 = 2.51 rad\r\n此外，\r\nθ\r\n360° = 2.51\r\n2π\r\n θ = 144°\r\n(c) 思薇的線速率 = rω = 3 × 0.314 = 0.942 m s–1\r\n珊妮的線速率 = rω = 2 × 0.314 = 0.628 m s–1\r\n"},{"page":7,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.288983398437495,184.16530090332031,586.0579833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n轉半圈時，θ = π。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-209-2":{"id":"ex-209-2","chapter":"209","number":2,"title":"向心加速度和半徑","question":"<p>如圖所示，跑車在賽道上以 40 m s<sup>–1</sup> 恆速率奔馳。賽道包含兩段半徑不同的圓形彎路。</p><p>(a) 求跑車在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的向心加速度。</p><p>(b) 跑車在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點還是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的加速度較大？試解釋原因。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/8996ff5555ce21f927a35bea.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:149.5px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 向心加速度 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v^{2}}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>40</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>150</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{40^{2}}{150}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 10.7 m s<sup>–2</sup></p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點所在的彎路半徑 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 較小。根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v^{2}}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ，當線速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相同，跑</p><p>車在 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的加速度 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span> 較大。</p>","tips":"","think":"<p>Simon 根據 a = rω² 認為，因為 Y 處半徑較小，汽車在 Y 處的加速度也較小。解釋他的推論為甚麼不正確。</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>角速度並不恆定。線速度 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 固定，因此在較小半徑處，<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>ω</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 會增加。代入後得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。所以 Y 處半徑較小，加速度反而較大。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[188.4833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.4833009033202,239.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 2 向心加速度和半徑\r\n如圖所示，跑車在賽道上以 40 m s–1 恆速率奔\r\n馳。賽道包含兩段半徑不同的圓形彎路。\r\n(a) 求跑車在 X 點的向心加速度。\r\n(b) 跑車在 X 點還是 Y 點的加速度較大？試解釋\r\n原因。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[188.4833009033203,239.6500701904297,565.4833009033202,368.1869833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 向心加速度 = v2\r\nr = 402\r\n150\r\n = 10.7 m s–2\r\n(b) Y 點所在的彎路半徑 r 較小。根據 a = v2\r\nr\r\n，當線速率 v 相同，跑\r\n車在 Y 點的加速度 a 較大。\r\nX\r\nY\r\nu = 40 m s–1\r\nr = 150 m\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.48300090332032,357.6370849984375,568.4830009033203,446.3530849984375],"text":"想一想\r\n施宏認為 Y 點所在的彎路半徑較小，因此根據 a = rω2\r\n，跑車在 Y 點\r\n的加速度應該也較小。解釋為甚麼他的理據並不正確。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-209-3":{"id":"ex-209-3","chapter":"209","number":3,"title":"乾爽和濕滑路面的最高速率","question":"<p>質量為 800 kg 的汽車駛過半徑為 20 m 的彎角。路面乾爽時，汽車與路面之間的最大側向摩擦力是 5500 N。</p><p>(a) 汽車不打滑的最高速率 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是多少？</p><p>(b) 為甚麼汽車在雨天打滑的機會較大？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>a</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></msqrt></mrow></math> = 11.7 m s<sup>−1</sup></p><p>(b) 雨天時汽車與路面之間的最大摩擦力減少。摩擦力因而較容易不足以提供所需的向心力。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>當 F 最大時，汽車的速率達到 v<sub>max</sub>。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":20,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,457.3509833984375,560.2833009033203,596.6670684814453],"text":"例 題 3 乾爽和濕滑路面的最高速率\r\n質量為 800 kg 的汽車駛過半徑為 20 m 的彎角。路面乾爽時，汽車與\r\n路面之間的最大側向摩擦力是 5500 N。\r\n(a) 汽車不打滑的最高速率 vmax 是多少？\r\n(b) 為甚麼汽車在雨天打滑的機會較大？\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,596.6670684814453,560.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 根據 F = mv2\r\nr ，\r\nvmax = •  \r\nFmaxr\r\nm = •  \r\n5500 × 20\r\n800\r\n = 11.7 m s–1\r\n(b) 雨天時，汽車和路面之間的最大摩擦力會下降，摩擦力不足以提\r\n供所需向心力的情況便有較大機會出現。\r\n"},{"page":20,"kind":"tips","box":[40,453.3509833984375,179.2833009033203,746.2039833984375],"text":"提提你\r\nF 為最大值時，汽車的速率\r\n便達到 vmax。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-209-4":{"id":"ex-209-4","chapter":"209","number":4,"title":"飛機轉彎","question":"<p>質量為 4 × 10<sup>6</sup> kg 的飛機以恆速率沿水平路徑轉彎，作用於它的升力與垂直線構成夾角 θ。</p><p>(a) 如果 θ = 5°，升力的量值 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是多少？</p><p>(b) 求轉彎所需的向心力。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/6f35592745fc1f9231ce4951.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:273.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 考慮垂直方向。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> cos θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{mg}{cos θ}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>106</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>9.81</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{(4 \\times  106) \\times  9.81}{cos 5°}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 3.94 × 10<sup>7</sup> N</p><p>(b) 考慮水平方向。</p><p>向心力</p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin 5° = (3.94 × 10<sup>7</sup>) × sin 5° = 3.43 × 10<sup>6</sup> N</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/8427329343e8162912905f8f.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:130.3px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>升力提供向心力。</p>","think":"<p>現在飛機的質量減少。如果它以相同速率沿相同路徑轉彎，θ 應如何改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>角度維持 5° 不變。由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cos</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 及 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>sin</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>tan</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>θ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>r</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。質量消去。所需升力按質量的比例減小，但方向不變。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":23,"kind":"question","box":[188.28297420332035,534.6690862984375,565.2829742033204,749.2040862984375],"text":"例 題 4 飛機轉彎\r\n質量為 4 × 106\r\n kg 的飛機以恆速率沿水平路徑轉彎，作用於它的升力\r\n與垂直線構成夾角 θ。\r\nθ L\r\n(a) 如果 θ = 5°，升力的量值 L 是多少？\r\n(b) 求轉彎所需的向心力。\r\n"},{"page":24,"kind":"answer","box":[183.28300480332032,58.91007995605469,560.2830048033203,281.4471063984374],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 考慮垂直方向。\r\nL cos θ = mg\r\n L = mg\r\ncos θ\r\n = (4 × 106) × 9.81\r\ncos 5°\r\n = 3.94 × 107\r\n N\r\n(b) 考慮水平方向。\r\n向心力\r\n = L sin 5° = (3.94 × 107\r\n) × sin 5° = 3.43 × 106\r\n N\r\n5°\r\nmg\r\nL cos 5°\r\nL sin 5°\r\nL \r\n"},{"page":24,"kind":"tips","box":[40,49.334106398437484,179.28300480332032,281.4471063984374],"text":"提提你\r\n升力提供向心力。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-209-5":{"id":"ex-209-5","chapter":"209","number":5,"title":"理想傾斜角","question":"<p>某高速公路有一段半徑為 580 m 的彎道，駛過這段路面的汽車，平均速率是 20 m s<sup>–1</sup>。</p><p>(a) 求彎道的理想傾斜角。</p><p>(b) 質量為 1500 kg 的汽車以 20 m s<sup>–1</sup> 駛過上述彎道。假設彎道以理想傾斜角修築，求公路作用於汽車的法向力。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 考慮水平方向。</p><p>R R cos θ θ</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>r</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{mv^{2}}{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span> ……… (1) R sin θ 考慮垂直方向。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> cos θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> ……… (2) mg (1) 除以 (2)：</p><p>tan θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v^{2}}{gr}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>20</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>9.81</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>580</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{20^{2}}{9.81 \\times  580}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>θ = 4.02°</p><p>理想傾斜角是 4.02°。</p><p>(b) 根據 (2)，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{mg}{cos θ}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1500</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>9.81</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mn>4.02</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1500 \\times  9.81}{cos 4.02°}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 14 800 N</p><p>公路作用於汽車的法向力是 14 800 N。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/cc47afd7dce3e5a4a0481aff.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:123.2px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":26,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,188.26598339843758,560.2833009033203,349.58204650878906],"text":"例 題 5 理想傾斜角\r\n某高速公路有一段半徑為 580 m 的彎道，駛過這段路面的汽車，平均\r\n速率是 20 m s–1。\r\n(a) 求彎道的理想傾斜角。\r\n(b) 質量為 1500 kg 的汽車以 20 m s–1 駛過上述彎道。假設彎道以理\r\n想傾斜角修築，求公路作用於汽車的法向力。\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,349.58204650878906,560.2833009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 考慮水平方向。\r\nR sin θ = mv2\r\nr ⋯⋯⋯ (1)\r\n考慮垂直方向。\r\nR cos θ = mg ⋯⋯⋯ (2)\r\n (1) 除以 (2)：\r\n tan θ = v2\r\ngr\r\n = 202\r\n9.81 × 580\r\n θ = 4.02°\r\n理想傾斜角是 4.02°。\r\n(b) 根據 (2)，\r\nR = mg\r\ncos θ\r\n = 1500 × 9.81\r\ncos 4.02°\r\n = 14 800 N\r\n公路作用於汽車的法向力是 14 800 N。\r\nmg\r\nR R cos θ\r\nR sin θ\r\nθ\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-209-6":{"id":"ex-209-6","chapter":"209","number":6,"title":"以研究向心力的儀器驗證 T = mω2","question":"<p>參閱實驗 9a 的裝置。設膠塞的質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 20 g，螺絲帽的總質量 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 1 kg，長度為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的一段尼龍繩與垂直線構成的夾角是 θ。</p><p>(a) 求尼龍繩的張力 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 如果以較小的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 值重複實驗，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 θ 會怎樣改變？試簡單解釋原因。</p><p>(c) 證明 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω<sup>2</sup><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span>。據此，判斷如果以較小的 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 值重複實驗，ω 會怎樣改變。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/49db429645e80f0cc8141909.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:332.9px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 螺絲帽保持靜止，因此作用於它們的淨力為零。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Mg</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>= 1 × 9.81</p><p>= 9.81 N</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 仍然相等於螺絲帽的重量，因此它的值會保持不變。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> cos θ 仍然等於膠塞的重量。由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> 保持不變，θ 也會保持不變。</p><p>(c) 考慮水平方向。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mr</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω<sup>2</sup></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> × (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ) × ω<sup>2</sup></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω<sup>2</sup><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>根據方程，如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 減小，ω 便會增大。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/e435a250b3a3364d1c799c34.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:60.7px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/551ca8afa7516085b789b1b3.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:138.7px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>必須辨認在特定情況下哪些物理量的數值保持不變。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":33,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,565.2833009033203,436.9879608154297],"text":"例 題 6 以研究向心力的儀器驗證 T = mω2\r\nL\r\n參閱實驗 9a 的裝置。設膠塞的質量 m 是 20 g，螺絲帽的總質量 M\r\n是 1 kg，長度為 L 的一段尼龍繩與垂直線構成的夾角是 θ。\r\n玻璃管 θ L\r\n 紙標記\r\n（剛好在\r\n 玻璃管底） 螺絲帽\r\n膠塞\r\n(a) 求尼龍繩的張力 T。\r\n(b) 如果以較小的 L 值重複實驗，T 和 θ 會怎樣改變？試簡單解釋\r\n原因。\r\n(c) 證明 T = mω2\r\nL。據此，判斷如果以較小的 L 值重複實驗，ω 會怎\r\n樣改變。\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,436.9879608154297,565.2833009033203,752.5249833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 螺絲帽保持靜止，因此作用於它們的淨力為零。\r\nT = Mg\r\n = 1 × 9.81 \r\n = 9.81 N\r\n(b) T 仍然相等於螺絲帽的重量，因此它的值會\r\n保持不變。\r\nT cos θ 仍然等於膠塞的重量。由於 T 保持\r\n不變，θ 也會保持不變。\r\n(c) 考慮水平方向。\r\nT sin θ = mrω2\r\nT sin θ = m × (L sin θ) × ω2\r\n T = mω2\r\nL\r\n根據方程，如果 L 減小，ω 便會增大。\r\nMg\r\nT\r\nmg\r\nr\r\nT θ T cosθ\r\nT sinθ\r\nθ\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,184.2833009033203,752.5249833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n我們必須懂得判斷在特定情\r\n況下哪些物理量的數值固定\r\n不變。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-209-7":{"id":"ex-209-7","chapter":"209","number":7,"title":"吊在天花板的玩具飛機","question":"<p>質量為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的玩具飛機以恆角速率 ω 沿水平的圓形路徑轉動，路徑的半徑是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span>，繩子的張力是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span>，繩子與垂直線構成的夾角是 θ。</p><p>(a) 證明 cos θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mrow><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{g}{ω^{2}L}</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>(b) 如果玩具飛機加快轉動，θ 會怎樣改變？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/082ce3ea5b4784281081fa56.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:340.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 考慮水平方向。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mr</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω<sup>2</sup></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> × (<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> sin θ) × ω<sup>2</sup></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω<sup>2</sup><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> ……………… (1) 考慮垂直方向。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span> cos θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span> ……………… (2) 把 (1) 代入 (2)：</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span>ω<sup>2</sup><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> × cos θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mg</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>cos θ = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>g</mi><mrow><msup><mi>ω</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{g}{ω^{2}L}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>(b) θ 會增加。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/870aa15dd2ce401f3d5aa267.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:138.7px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>根據 cos θ = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>g</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>ω</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，</p><p>當 L 恆定時，</p><p>ω ↑ ⇒ cos θ ↓ ⇒ θ ↑</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_209_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"75505c8a7c411add65076b79f41dafc803f22fe7d8e58ebabb7701f35ea0e249","segments":[{"page":34,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,331.95188903808594],"text":"例 題 7 吊在天花板的玩具飛機\r\n質量為 m 的玩具飛機以恆角速率 ω 沿水平的圓形路徑轉動，路徑的\r\n半徑是 r，繩子的張力是 T，繩子與垂直線構成的夾角是 θ。\r\nθ\r\n(a) 證明 cos θ = g\r\nω2\r\nL\r\n。\r\n(b) 如果玩具飛機加快轉動，θ 會怎樣改變？\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,331.95188903808594,560.2833009033203,584.4889833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 考慮水平方向。\r\nT sin θ = mrω2\r\nT sin θ = m × (L sin θ) × ω2\r\n T = mω2\r\nL ⋯⋯⋯⋯⋯⋯ (1)\r\n考慮垂直方向。\r\nT cos θ = mg ⋯⋯⋯⋯⋯⋯ (2)\r\n把 (1) 代入 (2)：\r\nmω2\r\nL × cos θ = mg\r\n cos θ = g\r\nω2\r\nL\r\n(b) θ 會增加。\r\nmg\r\nr\r\nT θ T cosθ\r\nT sinθ\r\nθ\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.2833009033203,584.4889833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n根據 cos θ = g\r\nω2\r\nL\r\n，\r\n當 L 固定不變，\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}